				<wikidot:authorName>Djoric</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>388108</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Some people have claimed that they don't get what this is a reference to. I shall elucidate in the Socratic method, by asking another question.</p> <p>In what context do we most normally find a group of generally unwashed individuals building campfires on a regular weekly basis during the summer months, and then proceeding to partake in overwrought rituals that end in an awful pun?</p> <p>(Psssst the answer is summer camp. This is a summer camp skit. Alas, it seems that once again the format works against me.)</p> 
				 	]]>
