				<wikidot:authorName>Djoric</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>388108</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Japucha is pronounced &quot;ja poo cha&quot; or &quot;ja put cha&quot;. (There are variants of the skit, I'm using the one I've performed, which is the former). Which is just kinda a borked way of saying &quot;you put your&quot;.</p> <p>you put your -&gt; ya put ya -&gt; ya putcha -&gt; japucha</p> <p>And nobody thus far has even noticed how the containment terrarium contains a rare bird (possessing of rare wings and rare feathers and ticks that need to be more rare), and how the bird's on the egg and the egg's on the nest and the nest's on the twig and the twig's on the branch and the branch's on the tree and the tree's in the bog and the <em>bog's down in the valley-o!</em></p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
